			"color":"#232",
			"widgets_values":[
				"Fashion runway catwalk video, 5 seconds, using the reference image only as character appearance reference.\n\nA slim female model with long straight black hair and round glasses walks on a beauty pageant runway. She wears the same blue one-piece swimsuit, white sash, red number 61 badge, necklace, bracelet, and black high heels. Preserve her exact identity, hairstyle, glasses, outfit details, and elegant appearance. The reference image is a multi-view sheet only; generate one single model in one realistic runway scene, not a collage.\n\n[0.0s–1.5s]\nFull-body frontal shot. The model begins walking forward on the runway with elegant, natural catwalk steps. Soft spotlight illuminates her. Her expression is calm and confident.\n\n[1.5s–3.5s]\nThe camera smoothly tracks backward as she approaches. Her long hair gently sways, the sash moves slightly, and her heels step rhythmically on the glossy runway. The audience area remains softly blurred.\n\n[3.5s–5.0s]\nThe framing moves slightly closer to a three-quarter/full-body shot. She gives a subtle runway pose shift while continuing forward, maintaining a gentle smile and graceful posture. End with a polished fashion-show hero moment.\n\nRealistic anatomy, stable face, stable glasses, stable hands, natural walking, smooth motion, cinematic runway atmosphere.\n\nAvoid split-screen, multi-panel layout, duplicate people, deformed limbs, warped body, outfit inconsistency, face inconsistency, exaggerated motion, and camera shake."
			],
